          "type": "DateTime!",
          "description": "The EarliestStartAt is = the Earliest Start At date/time from the collection of Work Order Processes within the Group. This represents the abosolute earliest possible date/time this group can be scheduled to start at.\n\nField maybe edited by the user, this would impact the scheduling. This field makes no impact after scheduling has been completed.\n\nREQUIRED (no default in API)",
