          "type": "DateTime",
          "description": "The date/time determined by scheduling of when this group will finish, This date/time should never exceed the latestEndAt - if it does, this should generated a scheduling exception.\n\nThis field must be read Only after scheduling is completed - only deleting scheduled events for this group will delete this value.",
