          "name": "scheduledStartAt",
          "type": "DateTime",
          "description": "ScheduledStartAt is the date/time determined by scheduling of when this group can start based on workcenter capacity. This date should never be earlier than the earliestStartAt date/time - otherwise, this should generate a scheduling exception.\n\nThis field must be read Only after scheduling is completed - only deleting scheduled events for this group will delete this value.",
